&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://poly.ai?utm_source=prnewswire&amp;amp;utm_medium=pressrelease&amp;amp;utm_campaign=boilerplate&amp;amp;utm_content=pressrelease&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;PolyAI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is the Agentic Dialog Platform for building the conversational enterprise, used to build, run, govern, and improve dialog agents at scale. Powered by Raven, a proprietary dialog model trained on more than a billion enterprise conversations, PolyAI agents are built for complexity, open at every layer, and sovereign by design. PolyAI serves hundreds of enterprises across 75 languages and 25 countries, including Metro Bank, Marriott, PG&amp;amp;E, and UniCredit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Software Engineer &lt;strong&gt;to join the Runtime team&lt;/strong&gt; at PolyAI.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; This team owns the core voice infrastructure that powers every call our AI agents handle - from the moment a phone rings to the moment it hangs up.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work across the full real-time voice stack: telephony, real-time audio streaming and media handling, speech recognition and synthesis integration, LLM orchestration, turn-taking and voice activity detection, call recording, and the data pipeline that captures it all. We operate across AWS and Azure, serving enterprise customers at scale across multiple global regions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Design and build features across the voice runtime - from new integrations with third-party contact centre platforms, to improving how our agents handle interruptions and overlapping speech, to scaling our infrastructure for higher call volumes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Own services end-to-end: write code, review PRs from across the company, deploy to production, and support what you ship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Debug complex, cross-service issues in production - the kind where a timing problem involves VAD thresholds, ASR transcription windows, LLM response latency, and audio playback all interacting at once.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Contribute to architecture decisions and design documents. The team has strong thought leadership on stateful vs stateless service boundaries, API design, and where responsibilities should live.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product facing teams who build on top of the runtime - helping them understand configuration, troubleshooting call behaviour, and unblocking their work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Improve the developer experience: better defaults, less reliance on opaque config, more features controllable through the UI, and better test coverage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Must have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;4+ years of commercial software development experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong experience with real-time or latency-sensitive systems: streaming, media pipelines, networking, or similar domains where milliseconds matter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of distributed systems: gRPC, state management across services, connection error recovery, and working with systems that must not drop calls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure on AWS (EKS/Kubernetes, Lambda, S3, DynamoDB, Redis) - comfortable deploying containerised services and debugging infrastructure-level issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong written communication - design docs, PR reviews, and async debugging are core to how the team works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong plus:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with speech technologies: ASR, TTS, VAD, or end-of-turn detection — either integrating them or working on the systems around them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with Go - this is the primary language for our voice services. Most engineers on the team work across both Go and Python.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with Python - parts of our LLM orchestration layer, serverless function runtime, and data pipeline are Python.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prior work on LLM orchestration or agent frameworks: tool calling, function execution, prompt management, context window management, or conversation state machines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with data pipeline technologies: Kafka, ClickHouse, S3-based event stores, or similar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with observability at scale: Datadog, structured logging, SLO/SLI definition, and using metrics to drive reliability improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Multi-cloud experience (Azure in addition to AWS).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
